@base = http://localhost:3001

### health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### current tree
GET {{base}}/api/tree

### predict — should be Critical condition
POST {{base}}/api/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sleep": 5, "meetings": 7, "weekends": "Yes", "stress": 9.5 }

### retrain with entropy, depth 2
POST {{base}}/api/train
Content-Type: application/json

{ "params": { "maxDepth": 2, "criterion": "entropy" } }

### ❌ stress out of range -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sleep": 5, "meetings": 7, "weekends": "Yes", "stress": 42 }

### ❌ missing field -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sleep": 5, "weekends": "No", "stress": 3 }

### ❌ broken JSON -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sleep": 5,

### ❌ bad CSV -> 400 with line number
POST {{base}}/api/train
Content-Type: application/json

{ "csv": "sleep,meetings,weekends,stress,status\n7,3,Maybe,5,Healthy" }